    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1752730873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1752730873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1752730873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/6cf4b40ec44ee38f7d82af1ff96d94f6.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the map with the nun, she will closely follow behind the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although her assistance in battles may not be substantial,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she can offer help when she hears the voice of God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After going through various situations, you can even go on dates with nun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides her duties as a nun, you can also catch glimpses of her daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your intimacy level might lead to unexpected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final outcome you will face, it's all in your hands, as your choices will determine it!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/322670c8cca43a34b5e8458a90350148.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span>The village is in crisis due to attacks from goblins, orcs, and other so-called demi-humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers realize the need for a large-scale cleanup and plan to burn down the demi-humans' nests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Sister Hidori, who is entrusted by the church to manage the village, opposes the village's decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ladies and gentlemen, the blessings of the Lord will reach the demi-humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not wish for cruel acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let us resolve this issue peacefully through dialogue!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, with only one guard, the sister ventures into the depths of the forest...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heading towards the demi-humans' dwelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/1dc8f93586ab64616f8f176250b8a80b.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/8405ca0b5853c77f23a52b93b0f8eb9f.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG adventure gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 basic CGs! (excluding stills)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 H scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H-scenes include three elements: Fae rape/NTR/Pure Love!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three endings in total!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second half of the story is filled with waves of pure love in order to highlight the fae rape and NTR!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the blessing skill to send back to the village at any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue fast forward function</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG/event recall function included (needs to be purchased from the store)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/6cf4b40ec44ee38f7d82af1ff96d94f6.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the map with the nun, she will closely follow behind the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although her assistance in battles may not be substantial,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she can offer help when she hears the voice of God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After going through various situations, you can even go on dates with nun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides her duties as a nun, you can also catch glimpses of her daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your intimacy level might lead to unexpected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final outcome you will face, it's all in your hands, as your choices will determine it!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439620/extras/322670c8cca43a34b5e8458a90350148.avif?t=1752730873\" /></span>The village is in crisis due to attacks from goblins, orcs, and other so-called demi-humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers realize the need for a large-scale cleanup and plan to burn down the demi-humans' nests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Sister Hidori, who is entrusted by the church to manage the village, opposes the village's decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >